  dialogs:
  - name: Perfectionism
    dialog: Welcome back, Founder. Shall we start the project?
  - name: Founder
    dialog: Yes.
  - name: Perfectionism
    dialog: Good. First task's up.
  - name: Perfectionism
    dialog: Issue #224, we need visual assets for the game
  - name: Perfectionism
    dialog: And we're making them ourselves.
  - name: Perfectionism
    dialog: Free assets are how mediocre games get made
  - name: Perfectionism
    dialog: Fortunately, they're not us
